msgid "Example::"
msgstr "Contoh::"

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:36
msgid "Classes"
msgstr "Kelas"

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:40
msgid ""
"Construct a ``BMI270`` instance and run the full configuration-load "
"initialisation sequence. Raises ``OSError`` if the chip ID does not match or"
" if the load sequence fails."
msgstr ""
"Buat instans ``BMI270`` dan jalankan urutan inisialisasi pemuatan "
"konfigurasi penuh. Memunculkan ``OSError`` jika ID chip tidak cocok atau "
"jika urutan pemuatan gagal."

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:44
msgid "``bus``"
msgstr "``bus``"

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:45
msgid "A configured :py:class:`machine.I2C` bus the sensor is attached to."
msgstr ""
"Bus :py:class:`machine.I2C` yang telah dikonfigurasi tempat sensor "
"terpasang."

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:47
msgid "``cs``"
msgstr "``cs``"

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:48
msgid ""
"Reserved for SPI mode. Must be left as ``None``; SPI is not currently "
"implemented and supplying a non-I2C bus raises ``ValueError``."
msgstr ""
"Dicadangkan untuk mode SPI. Harus dibiarkan sebagai ``None``\\ ; SPI saat "
"ini belum diimplementasikan dan memberikan bus non-I2C akan memunculkan "
"``ValueError``\\ ."

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:52
msgid "``address``"
msgstr "``address``"

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:53
msgid ""
"7-bit I2C address of the device. Defaults to ``0x68``; some boards strap the"
" SDO pin high which selects ``0x69``."
msgstr ""
"Alamat I2C 7-bit perangkat. Defaultnya adalah ``0x68``\\ ; beberapa papan "
"menghubungkan pin SDO ke level tinggi sehingga memilih ``0x69``\\ ."

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:56
msgid "``gyro_odr``"
msgstr "``gyro_odr``"

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:57
msgid ""
"Gyroscope output data rate in Hz. Must be one of ``0.78``, ``1.5``, ``3.1``,"
" ``6.25``, ``12.5``, ``25``, ``50``, ``100``, ``200``, ``400``, ``800`` or "
"``1200``."
msgstr ""
"Laju data keluaran giroskop dalam Hz. Harus salah satu dari ``0.78``\\ , "
"``1.5``\\ , ``3.1``\\ , ``6.25``\\ , ``12.5``\\ , ``25``\\ , ``50``\\ , "
"``100``\\ , ``200``\\ , ``400``\\ , ``800`` atau ``1200``\\ ."

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:61
msgid "``gyro_scale``"
msgstr "``gyro_scale``"

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:62
msgid ""
"Gyroscope full-scale range in degrees-per-second. Must be one of ``125``, "
"``250``, ``500``, ``1000`` or ``2000``."
msgstr ""
"Rentang skala penuh giroskop dalam derajat per detik. Harus salah satu dari "
"``125``\\ , ``250``\\ , ``500``\\ , ``1000`` atau ``2000``\\ ."

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:65
msgid "``accel_odr``"
msgstr "``accel_odr``"

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:66
msgid ""
"Accelerometer output data rate in Hz. Same set of values as ``gyro_odr``."
msgstr ""
"Laju data keluaran akselerometer dalam Hz. Nilai yang sama dengan "
"``gyro_odr``\\ ."

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:69
msgid "``accel_scale``"
msgstr "``accel_scale``"

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:70
msgid ""
"Accelerometer full-scale range in g. Must be one of ``2``, ``4``, ``8`` or "
"``16``."
msgstr ""
"Rentang skala penuh akselerometer dalam satuan g. Harus salah satu dari "
"``2``\\ , ``4``\\ , ``8`` atau ``16``\\ ."

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:73
msgid "``bmm_magnet``"
msgstr "``bmm_magnet``"

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:74
msgid ""
"Optional `bmm150.BMM150` instance. When provided, the :meth:`magnet` method "
"delegates to it; otherwise :meth:`magnet` returns zeros."
msgstr ""
"Instans `bmm150.BMM150` opsional. Jika diberikan, metode :meth:`magnet` "
"mendelegasikan ke sana; jika tidak, :meth:`magnet` mengembalikan nol."

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:80
msgid ""
"Issue the BMI270 soft-reset command. After calling this the device must be "
"re-initialised before further use."
msgstr ""
"Keluarkan perintah soft-reset BMI270. Setelah memanggil ini, perangkat harus"
" diinisialisasi ulang sebelum digunakan lebih lanjut."

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:85
msgid ""
"Return the gyroscope vector ``(x, y, z)`` in degrees per second, scaled "
"according to ``gyro_scale``."
msgstr ""
"Kembalikan vektor giroskop ``(x, y, z)`` dalam derajat per detik, diskalakan"
" sesuai dengan ``gyro_scale``\\ ."

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:90
msgid ""
"Return the acceleration vector ``(x, y, z)`` in units of standard gravity (1"
" g = 9.81 m/s²), scaled according to ``accel_scale``."
msgstr ""
"Kembalikan vektor akselerasi ``(x, y, z)`` dalam satuan gravitasi standar (1"
" g = 9,81 m/s²), diskalakan sesuai dengan ``accel_scale``\\ ."

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:95
msgid ""
"If a ``bmm_magnet`` was supplied at construction, return the latest "
"magnetometer reading from that device. Otherwise return ``(0.0, 0.0, 0.0)``."
msgstr ""
"Jika ``bmm_magnet`` diberikan saat konstruksi, kembalikan pembacaan "
"magnetometer terbaru dari perangkat tersebut. Jika tidak, kembalikan ``(0.0,"
" 0.0, 0.0)``\\ ."
